# CODEOWNERS — workflow files require Nagu review.
#
# Rationale: COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY + COSIGN_PASSWORD are repo Actions
# secrets. A malicious step added to any workflow file in a PR would
# have access to them once merged. Requiring an explicit review on
# every workflow change is the standing control that makes the
# direct-GitHub-Secrets signing model acceptable.

/.github/workflows/   @nagug
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @nagug
